<h2>Conclusion<a href="#conclusion">#</a></h2>
<p>This packing list easily got me through a week in Montreal. I was able to wear the shirts multiple times, and I would wash my clothes if I needed to extend the trip indefinitely.  There was nothing that I was lacking, and I didn’t use all of the camera gear, would have loved to fly the drone around Old Port, next time.</p>